---
// ── Who is this for ───────────────────────────────────
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-title">Who is this for</div>
  <div class="who">
    <div class="whocol">
      <h3>For developers who…</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>want the container workflow they already know</li>
        <li>need stronger isolation than a shared-kernel container</li>
        <li>want one image that runs the same everywhere</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="whocol">
      <h3>For security &amp; platform teams who…</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>need a small, auditable trusted base at boot</li>
        <li>want reproducible builds and a measured launch</li>
        <li>are building toward hardware-attested confidential computing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .who {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .whocol {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .whocol h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .whocol ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .whocol li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .whocol li::before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
